    "title": "UGOOS UT8 PRO TV BOX Android 11.0 DDR4 8GB RAM 64GB ROM RK3568 WiFi6 Media Player BT Voice Remote UT8 4G 32G",
    "body_html": "<h1>SPECIFICATIONS</h1>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wireless: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>Weight: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">1KG</span></p>\n<p>WIFI: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Support WIFI 6</span></p>\n<p>Video Output: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">HDMI-Compatible 2.1</span></p>\n<p>Remote Control: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Included</span></p>\n<p>Power: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">DC 12V,2A</span></p>\n<p>OS: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">ANDROID</span></p>\n<p>Model Number: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">UT8 Pro</span></p>\n<p>Memory: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">4 gb DDR4,8G DDR3</span></p>\n<p>Max. Extended Capacity: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">TF Card Up To 32GB</span></p>\n<p>Internal Storage: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">32GB eMMC,64GB eMMC</span></p>\n<p>GPU: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">ARM Mali-G52 2EE</span></p>\n<p>GPU: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">ARM Mali-G52 2EE</span></p>\n<p>GOOGLE Cast: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">No</span></p>\n<p>Ethernet: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">1000M</span></p>\n<p>Certification: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">CE</span></p>\n<p>CPU: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Rockchip RK3568(Rockchip)+2.0G (64bit) Quad-Core Cortex-A55</span></p>\n<p>Brand Name: U<span style=\"color: #333333;\">goos</span></p>\n<p>Bluetooth: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>BT: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">5.0</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\">Ugoos\u00a0UT8\u00a0series Box with\u00a0RK3568 CPU,\u00a0it\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0real\u00a064\u00a0bit\u00a0kernel\u00a0and\u00a0system. It\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0little\u00a0more\u00a0powerful\u00a0than\u00a0S905X4,\u00a0and with a\u00a0better\u00a0GPU\u00a0but\u00a0no\u00a0AV1\u00a0support.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\">S922X\u00a0also\u00a0have\u00a0no\u00a0AV1\u00a0support,\u00a0but AM6 Plus\u00a0have\u00a0DV\u00a0license.\u00a0RK3568 Box doesn\u2019t have. So\u00a0the\u00a0main\u00a0difference\u00a0between UT8 Series and AM6B Plus is\u00a08GB RAM and 64 bit system of\u00a0UT8\u00a0and UT8 PR.\u00a0It\u00a0also\u00a0some\u00a0more\u00a0stronger\u00a0wifi6.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\"> So Is UT8 pro\u00a0are\u00a0stronger\u00a0than\u00a0AM6B\u00a0PLUS\uff1f</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\">1-It\u00a0depends\u00a0on\u00a0which\u00a0plans.\u00a0If\u00a0playing\u00a0games,\u00a0maybe\u00a0AM6B\u00a0plus\u00a0is\u00a0better.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\">As\u00a0S922X-J\u00a0is\u00a0stronger\u00a0as\u00a0CPU\u00a0than\u00a0RK3568\u00a0using\u00a0Cortex\u00a0A73\u00a0cores.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #0062b1; background-color: #ffffff;\">2-RK3568\u00a0is\u00a0same\u00a0as\u00a0S905X4\u00a0using\u00a0Cortex\u00a0A55\u00a0cores but\u00a0GPU\u00a0of\u00a0S905X4\u00a0is\u00a0G31 only,\u00a0while\u00a0RK3568\u00a0has\u00a0a\u00a0stronger\u00a0G52 GPU means UT8 series will have stronger image processing capabilities.</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color: #fa28ff;\">\u3010Highlight\u3011</strong></p>\n<p>- CPU: Rockchip RK3568(Rockchip)+2.0G (64bit) Quad-Core Cortex-A55</p>\n<p>- GPU: ARM Mali-G52 2EE</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #f44e3b;\">- Android 11.0 OS</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #f44e3b;\">- RAM: DDR4 8GB</span></p>\n<p>- ROM: 64GB eMMC</p>\n<p>- Support: 4K@60fps, HDR10</p>\n<p>- Support: 1000M LAN, 2T2R Wifi 6, BT5.0</p>\n<p>- Support : Audio Out, AUX IN</p>\n<p>- Support: 2*USB3.0 Host, 1*USB3.0 OTG, 1*USB 2.0</p>\n<p>- Support firmware wireless upgrade function</p>\n<p>- Configuration BT Voice Remote Control with Gyroscope</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color: #fa28ff;\">\u3010What's in box\u3011</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x Box</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 2 x WiFi Antenna</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x BT Remote Control</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x Power Adapter(5V/3A)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x HD Cable</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x User Manual</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">- 1 x Giftbox</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong style=\"background-color: #fa28ff;\">\u3010Pictures\u3011</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Cq9hWOoSlPFcWjOKvSRNd7ZCd4ZaFWIRTGIUjzvaPwDlwkwCZzN44WANpFvVqmLZ_uyG_CWONu2cJiy_TUAGYIIUR0ezTq0ZF8xPaI6QzWrgoUEaeA7GD0rQ0HBVXQemqdKxMV79PvTQuPvDdiFVeVwhZJSkCh3l-oOn9GL-6qIj8HJyXy5sWc4JmfEHkA4TXHok81RbqJ1CorVw2JZfpFvrjOxOzoFOZ_POlNh9-fTYE3Cfc11GC0kqmvOHZQT0NpFjFWMViV_8IR8UpXamUNrHqrXHJFkEHErnwWKyfm6l7UaRmSoATftyGzENcSWr1LYTZgJlYy8N8lG5_TXjBVW2tDagm8xc0zYodWydz9Pj6aXng_dBbsZ9PfJ91YXf0YJtzNmJlKI6BQzLR5UgjyX5y-CRKIURH1Xf3qen30LQVFle7NSyb3w5SVWjbkhdwrPSyrz9tLSOK35P8gQpipWq5nogqxZSwrJr1nWZD7h2Ael1eci0Xc3P71QjPm1kbyq2FXE-AEviG-COZJi6mLxl637io9ZnqOaL-J49bQKm6DSGzo6KB3F0yYxv9LZa0CEvL89hLL04QW-imObntywIg-w8ZylwQ5BR_W2Jh8YQTpd3eWLaarLCufy_OTSu1FqU0fC24v7GlIlB__qRMsYFgjXfc5ucYx7mNEyAlycuBh9yIHCgvbNV9N_e-DuWXus5cBzfRMtX4-aMxzNHCYQL_ALaRZvRlG0zdfJKru9FQOpWQ4IH9STwEyc218SCela__HuK8PEBIq6kqFULLgz-6vggklpKyOWqMb5sK19IdiJXtYkjlA7539QVjpphVzHTsyU=s929-no?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/B3C8ToGNE5UZWf1RZdjxwk0yRvz4TRv5W9ZDr9JwbwuEWt2WncnIjhfcsyLLzqjH4S0vRzgVXRLNW2n1qu3KUJmAgayA1HW7VC_oGCDHzCqBDG4EK8ZFIKb_arvUSwKa0lRGTfrFK81WYuoMHSOgZVQY3HuvrybxMaDi_lhXBv6Ri-QluWdh2SZjdF_jwsLpqANQr4ilbRpgyTc4mGF2DJ7x7DOSCC7EXa1Ca7RHHnZFGf8-P_2iIX1I_QVS2YQTp0LL3cCd5MtxsVXJxq6T4fyoM7y4gbe7jUXEKSJezI4laq7Kz5DE2eK-ojmCrMJa0ds-bED5KYxFTnUO_f-i4TB5GCI1cKql4wdAY5vNp6NHB_m8aPl8LYENOfsA1IkaM6M1xmgW1EEviEPSGDhX2WszYOFEFxA_SXOcaimfcvsc-vFVVmhfkPHp5j9fZYsr8pVhj7Yq6ZqbMkAXbKeX3vCZ_X0R7i5q-c0ZeolpfsJKRSrbhRtgbY_8f5uHrGzrwSm4uCUsPVPpJBI23BsoVUSNsn97mS3ze0W9Y5L5UhW9CzxxI9KBeKg0FxHvM